Rule (requirement): If there are rows in `suppliers` with that `nif`, and all of them have the same `id` and normalised `iban`, then that `iban` equals the normalised `iban` of the invoice. If there are no rows, it does not fire (R02). If the rows disagree with each other, it does not fire (R04).
